{
    "title": "Bike Hop: Crazy BMX Bike Jump",
    "description": "Can you travel over the globe on your BMX bike? Easily! Hop on your bicycle, spin fast your pedals and fly far using a powerful jetpack on your back! Play Bike Hop, jump high and beat new records in this fun bicycle game! Embark on an extreme BMX bike adventure!\r\n\r\nIn this bike game, your goal is to fly as far as you can. The further your BMX boy flies, the more points you earn! Feel the real joy from freestyle extreme riding.\r\n\r\nThe Bike Hop controls are super easy! Tap to start cycling, tap again to speed up, and then tap one more time to jetpack jump from the ramp! Tap, tap, tap multiple times to use your jetpack flying over hills, cows, motorcycles, carts, and even entire cities. Use the jetpack fuel wisely and do not fall!\r\n\r\nEarn in-game coins and upgrade your BMX boy to fly further and higher! Expand the tank of your jetpack or make the BMX ride faster. Don't forget to buy your dude a cool hat to look more stylish while flying all around the globe!\r\n\r\nWhy you\u2019ll love this BMX bike game:\r\n \r\n- Extreme BMX bike ride\r\n- Gripping flying gameplay\r\n- Numerous upgrades\r\n- Easy one-handed controls\r\n- Offline earnings\r\n- Good relaxing games\r\n- Tons of fun\r\n\r\nPlay the bicycle game wherever you go! Bike Hop is one of the most exciting games that don\u2019t require wifi.  \r\n \r\nExplore the world with the BMX bike and the jetpack on your back! Get a fun jumping game experience and become a crazy BMX bike stunt driver!\r\n\r\n========================\r\nCOMPANY COMMUNITY: \r\n========================\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/AzurGamesOfficial\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/azur_games\r\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/AzurInteractiveGames",
    "descriptionHTML": "Can you travel over the globe on your BMX bike? Easily! Hop on your bicycle, spin fast your pedals and fly far using a powerful jetpack on your back! Play Bike Hop, jump high and beat new records in this fun bicycle game! Embark on an extreme BMX bike adventure!<br><br>In this bike game, your goal is to fly as far as you can. The further your BMX boy flies, the more points you earn! Feel the real joy from freestyle extreme riding.<br><br>The Bike Hop controls are super easy! Tap to start cycling, tap again to speed up, and then tap one more time to jetpack jump from the ramp! Tap, tap, tap multiple times to use your jetpack flying over hills, cows, motorcycles, carts, and even entire cities. Use the jetpack fuel wisely and do not fall!<br><br>Earn in-game coins and upgrade your BMX boy to fly further and higher! Expand the tank of your jetpack or make the BMX ride faster. Don&#39;t forget to buy your dude a cool hat to look more stylish while flying all around the globe!<br><br>Why you\u2019ll love this BMX bike game:<br> <br>- Extreme BMX bike ride<br>- Gripping flying gameplay<br>- Numerous upgrades<br>- Easy one-handed controls<br>- Offline earnings<br>- Good relaxing games<br>- Tons of fun<br><br>Play the bicycle game wherever you go! Bike Hop is one of the most exciting games that don\u2019t require wifi.  <br> <br>Explore the world with the BMX bike and the jetpack on your back! Get a fun jumping game experience and become a crazy BMX bike stunt driver!<br><br>========================<br>COMPANY COMMUNITY: <br>========================<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/AzurGamesOfficial<br>Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/azur_games<br>YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/AzurInteractiveGames",
